# Normalise text to LF in the repo and let git decide the worktree. Later rules win, so the
# catch-all goes first.
*       text=auto

*.png   binary
*.ico   binary

# Importer fixtures are byte-exact test inputs: 05 is deliberately LF-only with a
# BOM, and a CRLF checkout would quietly turn it into a different test case.
test/fixtures/import/*  -text
test/fixtures/import/*.md  text
test/fixtures/import/*.mjs text
